{"id":1750,"date":"2025-03-28T16:00:00","date_gmt":"2025-03-28T16:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=1750"},"modified":"2025-04-03T09:46:55","modified_gmt":"2025-04-03T14:46:55","slug":"arkham-mysteries-available-now","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/arkham-mysteries-available-now\/","title":{"rendered":"Arkham Mysteries Available Now!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p><em>Arkham Mysteries<\/em>, the first collection of adventures for <em>Arkham Horror: The Roleplaying Game<\/em>, from EDGE Studio, is available now. <em>Arkham Mysteries <\/em>presents three unique tales offer mystery and terror for you and your friends across 96 pages of intrigue and danger&#8230;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>From EDGE Studio: <\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-block-quote-1RFwAA wp-block-lazyblock-block-quote\"><blockquote class=\"text-sand-white text-left px-8 md:pl-16 py-16 space-y-4 max-w-xl mx-auto\">\n    <p><p>In the darkened halls of the Miskatonic Museum, will the investigators survive\u00a0<strong>The Ophidian\u2019s Nightmare<\/strong>?<\/p>\n<p>When the latest supply of hooch starts making people sick, can the investigators find the source of a mysterious disease in\u00a0<strong>One For The Road<\/strong>?<\/p>\n<p>When occult knowledge is bestowed upon the initiated, do the investigators have what it takes to defeat\u00a0<strong>The Thricefold Power<\/strong>?<\/p>\n<p>The book also includes 2 double-sided poster maps.<\/p>\n<p><em>Arkham Mysteries<\/em>\u00a0is a set of three adventures for\u00a0<em>Arkham Horror \u2013 the Roleplaying Game<\/em>\u00a0and requires the\u00a0Core Rulebook\u00a0to play.<\/p><\/p>\n    <cite><\/cite>\n<\/blockquote><\/div>\n\n\n<p>EDGE have been previewing the three adventures over on their site, so check out <a href=\"https:\/\/www.edge-studio.net\/the-ophidians-nightmare\/\">The Ophidian&#8217;s Nightmare<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.edge-studio.net\/one-for-the-road\/\">One for the Road<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.edge-studio.net\/one-for-the-road-the-thricefold-power\/\">Thricefold Power<\/a> there. <\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-separator-1WyAsd wp-block-lazyblock-separator\"><div class=\"w-full h-px\"\n     style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.00) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.50) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.00) 100%);\"><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n<p>And if you or your players are headed to the Miskatonic Museum as part of The Ophidian&#8217;s Curse, be sure to pick up a free Visitor Guide for the museum and its latest exhibit\u2026<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/cdn.svc.asmodee.net\/production-arkhamhorror\/uploads\/2025\/03\/Miskatonic-Museum-Guide-Natural-History-Exhibit.pdf\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.svc.asmodee.net\/production-arkhamhorror\/uploads\/2025\/03\/Download-Button.svg\" alt=\"Download the Miskatonic Museum guide PDF now\" class=\"wp-image-989\" style=\"width:250px\"\/><\/a><\/figure><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-simple-image-zD1sI wp-block-lazyblock-simple-image\">\n<section class=\"simple-image flex justify-center items-center w-full py-[75px]\">\n            <div class=\"container simple-width relative max-w-[800px] w-full mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/products\/background_thumbnail.png\"\n                     class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center rotate-3\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/products\/thumbnail.png\"\n                     class=\"absolute w-full z-10 thumbnail_news\" style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px; transform: rotate(1deg);\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.svc.asmodee.net\/production-arkhamhorror\/uploads\/image-converter\/2025\/03\/Miskatonic-Museum-Guide-Natural-History-Exhibit_header_L.webp\"\n                     class=\"absolute h-full w-full object-cover rotate-1 thumbnail_bg\"\n                     style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px;\">\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section><\/div>\n\n\n<p>The Visitor Guide was produced by the folks at Aconyte Books and first given away at GAMA 2025 to promote <em>Arkham Mysteries<\/em>. It sets the scene without spoilers so you can even print it out and use it as handout in your games. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1759,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"key-tag":[17,37,18],"class_list":["post-1750","news","type-news","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","key-tag-books","key-tag-edge-studio","key-tag-rpgs"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v22.3 (Yoast SEO v22.9) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Arkham Mysteries Available Now! | ArkhamHorror.com | The Official Arkham Horror Website News<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/arkham-mysteries-available-now\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Arkham Mysteries Available Now! | ArkhamHorror.com | The Official Arkham Horror Website News\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The first collection of adventures for Arkham Horror: The Roleplaying Game is available now! Find out more on ArkhamHorror.com\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/arkham-mysteries-available-now\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"ArkhamHorror.com | The Official Arkham Horror Website\" \/>